      "review_summary": "The branch adds current-attempt replay state and metadata, uses it to gate silent provider-error retries, and routes empty `server_error` failover turns into the retry path.\n\nPR surface: Source +48, Tests +111. Total +159 across 14 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main feeds cumulative replay metadata into the silent provider-error retry gate and rejects retry once prior side effects dirty that metadata. I did not run a live provider reproduction in this read-only review.",
